- "Return **all** subsets / permutations / combinations / partitions"
- Constraint puzzles: N-Queens, Sudoku, word search in grid
- Small n (≈ ≤ 20) — exponential is acceptable
- Choose → explore → un-choose

**Java**

```java
// Signal: "all" combinations / permutations / placements.
List<List<Integer>> permute(int[] nums) {
    List<List<Integer>> res = new ArrayList<>();
    go(nums, new boolean[nums.length], new ArrayList<>(), res);
    return res;
}

void go(int[] nums, boolean[] used, List<Integer> path, List<List<Integer>> res) {
    if (path.size() == nums.length) { res.add(new ArrayList<>(path)); return; }
    for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {
        if (used[i]) continue;
        used[i] = true; path.add(nums[i]);
        go(nums, used, path, res);
        used[i] = false; path.remove(path.size() - 1);
    }
}
```

