**Pattern:** multi-source BFS.

- Enqueue **all** rotten cells at minute 0; count fresh
- BFS level by level; each level = 1 minute; rot neighbors, decrement fresh
- Answer = minutes if fresh == 0, else -1

**Java**

```java
int orangesRotting(int[][] g) {
    int R = g.length, C = g[0].length, fresh = 0, mins = 0;
    Deque<int[]> q = new ArrayDeque<>();
    for (int r = 0; r < R; r++) for (int c = 0; c < C; c++) {
        if (g[r][c] == 2) q.offer(new int[]{r, c});
        else if (g[r][c] == 1) fresh++;
    }
    int[][] dirs = {{1, 0}, {-1, 0}, {0, 1}, {0, -1}};
    while (!q.isEmpty() && fresh > 0) { // multi-source BFS by level
        mins++;
        for (int n = q.size(); n > 0; n--) {
            int[] p = q.poll();
            for (int[] d : dirs) {
                int r = p[0] + d[0], c = p[1] + d[1];
                if (r < 0 || c < 0 || r >= R || c >= C || g[r][c] != 1) continue;
                g[r][c] = 2; fresh--; q.offer(new int[]{r, c});
            }
        }
    }
    return fresh == 0 ? mins : -1;
}
```

